# Block30 trace gate

Target trace class: `conditional_support`.

## Allowed green statement

On a supplied joint output-Record controller and finite declared Blank
carrier, each frozen Block28 lateral output pair has a literal four-step
straight/turn successor to a fresh returned-facing pair.  The construction is
translation/proper-cubic/side-exchange covariant, preserves old Records, has a
full STOP, costs exactly eight fresh Record blocks, admits at least two route
choices on the opposite sector, and supports both supplied `lambda=0` and
`lambda=1/2` laws with the same non-`q` handoff data.

## Forbidden promotions

A green result does not make the joint controller nearest-neighbor, autonomous,
or physically generated.  It does not prove exact route multiplicity, derive
or select `q`, execute a second pair instrument, provide renewal or cadence,
attach gravity, amend an axiom, set an audit verdict, retire an obligation, or
move a TOE percentage.

## Dispatch

- green common handoff: stop the supplied-control coupling classification at
  `MANY/UNDERSELECTED` and launch the causal Record-comparison compiler;
- one-law failure: independently isolate the exact `q`-dependent obstruction;
- common route/factor failure: repair only the named map; and
- incomplete or timeout: make no scientific inference.
